      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹77.36 (vs ₹67.04 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹77.36 (up from ₹67.04 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹8.90b (up 13% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹965.5m (up 15% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 12% per year.",
