      "date": "2026-01-23T11:54:00.000Z",
      "title": "India Motor Parts & Accessories Limited Declares Interim Dividend for the Year 2025-26, Payable on or Before 20 February, 2026",
      "body": "India Motor Parts & Accessories Limited, at the board meeting held on 22 January, 2026 have declared an Interim Dividend of INR 10/- (100%) per equity share of INR 10/- each, absorbing a sum of INR 124.8 million for the year 2025-26. The Record date has been fixed on the 29 January, 2026 for this purpose and dividend will be paid on or before 20 February, 2026.",
